# SRE AI LLM Work

Retargeted hitchhiker pipeline → **SRE / LLM-ops** handbook. Canonical agent
context: [`AGENTS.md`](AGENTS.md).

## Remotes

- **`origin`** = `lucas-albers-lz4/sre-ai-llm-work` (all push/pull)
- **`upstream`** = steveash hitchhiker (fetch only — never push)

## Ownership

| Path | Owner | Local agents |
|------|-------|----------------|
| `source-notes/` | Miner | OK to draft/fix notes + PRs |
| `guide/` | Smith | Only if user asks for guide synthesis |
| `registry/sources.json` | Generated | Never hand-edit |
| `agents/*.md` | Humans | Edit carefully; CI loads these as prompts |
| `.github/workflows/` | Humans | Prefer `PROJECT_PAT` for push/PR jobs |

## MVP models

- Triage/crawl: DeepSeek Flash
- Miner: OpenRouter `tencent/hy3:free` until **2026-07-21**
- Assayer/Smith: DeepSeek Pro
- Details: `docs/MODEL-ROUTING.md`

## Do not

- Merge `miner-eval` / `*-hy3-eval.md` into the corpus
- File secrets in git; use repo Actions secrets
- Assume Claude GitHub App OIDC — this fork bypasses it with API keys + PAT
